 bx('pk', '<b>Important distinction:</b> these laws give effect to related constitutional objectives. Not every breach of a Fundamental Duty automatically becomes a criminal offence.'),
 sec('COMMITTEE RECOMMENDATIONS', 'b'),
 t('<b>Justice J. S. Verma Committee (1999)</b> studied how duties can be promoted through education and awareness. It recommended: include Fundamental Duties in <b>school curricula and civic education</b>; use educational material and mass media; <b>train teachers</b> in constitutional values; identify existing laws that give effect to the duties.',
   '<b>NCRWC (2002)</b> recommended: a <b>duty to vote</b> (encourage participation in elections); a <b>duty to pay taxes</b> as a civic responsibility; <b>responsible parenthood</b>; and stronger civic education on duties. These were recommendations and <b>have not all been put into Article 51A</b>.'),
