 t('<b>Balanced position.</b> Rights and duties are <b>complementary, not competing</b>. Citizens should respect their duties, but duties must not become an excuse to weaken individual liberty, equality or constitutional safeguards.',
   '<b>Way forward:</b> teach duties alongside rights (civic education); promote constitutional values through schools, media and community programmes; use specific laws where necessary, subject to Fundamental Rights; governments must fulfil their own constitutional duties; encourage voting, environmental protection, public service and community cooperation.'),
